{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn More About \u201cDesserted\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDesserted\u201d is a cooperative adventure and horror game supporting up to 6 players. Set in a forsaken universe abandoned by the God of Calories, you must work together to survive on desolate planets with dynamic weather and environments. Scavenge diverse food sources, explore intricate mechanisms, and face off against monsters that grow stronger with each passing cycle. When danger strikes, use your wits to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete calorie objectives to earn rewards that enhance both yourself and your space station, preparing you to tackle increasingly deadly survival cycles. Cooperation is key to conquering the challenges that await in this unforgiving cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/45278df9c3b27ca641ec9d2d008acc6e.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/183ec9d8b2e5e51dc10a5fbd0cca672e.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/183ec9d8b2e5e51dc10a5fbd0cca672e.webm?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of 6 and explore different environments abandoned by the gods, where every inch of land is rotting away. Churches, labs, mazes\u2014once sanctuaries, now graveyards. Survive god-forsaken storms and anomalous weather as divine punishment rains down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/490e620959ad4e713a499b674100e602.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/724ea6477d4f336cb53db107cc10c5a7.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/724ea6477d4f336cb53db107cc10c5a7.webm?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/724ea6477d4f336cb53db107cc10c5a7.mp4?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate procedurally generated environments for any scrap of food to sustain you. Eat to Live. Live to Loot. Loot to Survive. Remember A.B.C.: <i><strong>Always Be Chewing.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/503cad0e92bc98722fcba0ed3c11ad26.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.webm?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.mp4?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one wants to dine alone. Work together to combine ingredients, discover new recipes, and boost caloric intake for all.\u00a0\u00a0<i><strong>Eat together, or die faster.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/217875b735fcb5ce89cf1a297174167f.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/dd65770b75e7273f95a8a551b87aab2c.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/dd65770b75e7273f95a8a551b87aab2c.webm?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/dd65770b75e7273f95a8a551b87aab2c.mp4?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the universe is hunting for food. Beyond you and your friends, countless horrors roam: Jack-O-Lantern, Security Guards, Spud Gunslinger, Mothman\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you meet them, either run or strike first with your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/f32a9ef09d466c462383ad75196cc7ec.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/2d233eb122b8ce1e394bf8a992082512.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/2d233eb122b8ce1e394bf8a992082512.webm?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/2d233eb122b8ce1e394bf8a992082512.mp4?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve eaten enough, it\u2019s time for the retribution. Offer everything to the God of Calories. Do you eat to satisfy hunger\u2026 or to prepare for the offering?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to the Porcelain Altar and present your calories to Calix, the Devourer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/3cc0fca17b39b059c34fc81415a27685.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/0226aef1720cde7c3709d4ede0d6dca9.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/0226aef1720cde7c3709d4ede0d6dca9.webm?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/0226aef1720cde7c3709d4ede0d6dca9.mp4?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every switch, every door, every shadow hides the key to extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors should never be opened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Escape. Sacrifice. Rebirth.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each cycle, you inch closer to the truth\u2014or madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Return to the station. Upgrade. Descend into a harder world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for up to 6-player online cooperative play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Add to your Steam Wishlist and check for the latest updates</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because\u2014Hunger Never Stops.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952820?t=1768944746","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3952820?t=1768944746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/0c377e607d5ef21874852f569982f102eb9631bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768944746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/0c377e607d5ef21874852f569982f102eb9631bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768944746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn More About \u201cDesserted\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDesserted\u201d is a cooperative adventure and horror game supporting up to 6 players. Set in a forsaken universe abandoned by the God of Calories, you must work together to survive on desolate planets with dynamic weather and environments. Scavenge diverse food sources, explore intricate mechanisms, and face off against monsters that grow stronger with each passing cycle. When danger strikes, use your wits to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete calorie objectives to earn rewards that enhance both yourself and your space station, preparing you to tackle increasingly deadly survival cycles. Cooperation is key to conquering the challenges that await in this unforgiving cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/45278df9c3b27ca641ec9d2d008acc6e.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/183ec9d8b2e5e51dc10a5fbd0cca672e.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/183ec9d8b2e5e51dc10a5fbd0cca672e.webm?t=1768944746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of 6 and explore different environments abandoned by the gods, where every inch of land is rotting away. Churches, labs, mazes\u2014once sanctuaries, now graveyards. Survive god-forsaken storms and anomalous weather as divine punishment rains down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/490e620959ad4e713a499b674100e602.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras/724ea6477d4f336cb53db107cc10c5a7.poster.avif?t=1768944746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3952820/extras